00:22:59,200 --> 00:22:59,920
She can't eat that.

300
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:02,319
I only had a taste.

301
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:04,240
Li, I'm going home. Bye.

302
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:05,480
Bye, ma'am.

303
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:06,519
Bye.

304
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:08,480
Don't eat too much. It's not clean.

305
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,319
I only had one bite.

306
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:14,480
Mr. Gu,

307
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:17,119
we asked you here

308
00:23:17,559 --> 00:23:19,079
about what you came

309
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,240
to ask us last time.

310
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,200
You were looking for

311
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,640
the girl who did that good deed.

312
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,599
Found her?

313
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,640
No.

314
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:27,119
We still haven't found her.

315
00:23:27,559 --> 00:23:28,640
But I think

316
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:31,480
that kind of public spirit

317
00:23:31,759 --> 00:23:33,119
deserves encouragement.

318
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,559
Don't you agree?

319
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:35,519
Yes.

320
00:23:36,759 --> 00:23:37,559
Please wait here.

321
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:44,000
Ma Na, come in.

322
00:23:53,400 --> 00:23:54,759
I wet my pants.

323
00:23:54,799 --> 00:23:56,000
Louder.

324
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,640
I wet my pants!

325
00:24:01,759 --> 00:24:03,319
Mr. Gu, here's the situation.

326
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:06,039
We never found that girl.

327
00:24:06,559 --> 00:24:08,000
But we believes

328
00:24:08,599 --> 00:24:10,480
we should promote

329
00:24:10,519 --> 00:24:12,200
the values of today's students.

330
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:13,400
So.

331
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,039
I understand.

332
00:24:21,519 --> 00:24:23,960
You couldn't find the real girl,

333
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,759
so you found a stand-in.

334
00:24:26,000 --> 00:24:26,440
No.

335
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:28,200
She's not a stand-in.

336
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:30,400
She's a student representative.

337
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:32,200
Her school

338
00:24:32,319 --> 00:24:33,359
recommended her.

339
00:24:34,359 --> 00:24:36,480
She performs well in every area.

340
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,960
She's polite and kind.

341
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:41,599
And she presents well.

342
00:24:41,799 --> 00:24:43,640
So I think we could

343
00:24:44,119 --> 00:24:46,440
invite the TV station

344
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:49,160
to film a piece promoting

345
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:51,079
the spirit of helping others.

346
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,359
Deputy Chief Xu, I'm sorry.

347
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:55,640
I can't do this.

348
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:58,799
You can't fail to find the real girl

349
00:24:59,160 --> 00:25:00,960
and promote a fake one instead.

350
00:25:01,079 --> 00:25:02,720
Sorry. I'm leaving.

351
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,200
Wait.

352
00:25:03,799 --> 00:25:04,359
Mr. Gu.

353
00:25:04,759 --> 00:25:06,559
She's not fake.

354
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:08,480
She's the student representative.

355
00:25:08,640 --> 00:25:09,640
Mr. Gu, please.

356
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:11,640
Please wait.

357
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:12,319
Just wait a moment.

358
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:15,480
Her father

359
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,559
is a prominent local businessman,

360
00:25:17,799 --> 00:25:19,920
Mr. Ma Dongchen.

361
00:25:20,559 --> 00:25:21,000
Mr. Ma?

362
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:21,799
Yes.

363
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:24,160
He runs Zhongyu Construction.

364
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:25,960
You've heard of him, right?

365
00:25:28,119 --> 00:25:29,200
(All right, Su.)

366
00:25:29,279 --> 00:25:29,920
(That's it, Su.)

367
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,559
I have.

368
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:35,720
See?

369
00:25:42,359 --> 00:25:43,039
Your name is...

370
00:25:45,359 --> 00:25:45,920
Ma Na.

371
00:25:46,759 --> 00:25:47,519
What class are you in?

372
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:48,799
Hospitality.

373
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:50,240
Class of '92, Hospitality.

374
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:51,480
Why?

375
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:56,720
How do you get along
with your classmates?

376
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:01,480
Fine.

377
00:26:01,960 --> 00:26:03,119
Why are you asking?

378
00:26:04,559 --> 00:26:05,960
I'm supposed to play along,

379
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,200
so I need to know.

380
00:26:08,599 --> 00:26:09,519
It should be fine.

381
00:26:09,839 --> 00:26:11,599
The school recommended her.

382
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,519
Did you get along with Su Lin?

383
00:26:23,799 --> 00:26:24,680
Who's Su Lin?

384
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:26,480
Your classmate, Su Lin.

385
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:27,240
You don't know her?

386
00:26:28,279 --> 00:26:31,039
Your father knows her father.

387
00:26:35,599 --> 00:26:36,400
Ridiculous.

388
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,480
Where are you going?

389
00:26:38,039 --> 00:26:39,200
He's treating me like a suspect,

390
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:40,319
asking endless questions.

391
00:26:40,759 --> 00:26:41,799
Someone else can do it.

392
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:42,680
What a creep.

393
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:47,200
Ma Na.

394
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,279
Ma Na!

395
00:26:53,359 --> 00:26:54,160
Ma Dongchen.

396
00:26:54,799 --> 00:26:55,880
Director Chen, rest assured.

397
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:56,960
As for quality,

398
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,839
ours is always guaranteed.

399
00:27:01,319 --> 00:27:02,079
What is it?

400
00:27:10,319 --> 00:27:11,480
What's wrong now?

401
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:13,640
That old man knows Su Lin.

402
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:14,799
What old man?

403
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:15,720
The one

404
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:17,359
looking for that helpful student.

405
00:27:17,559 --> 00:27:18,759
The second he heard my class,

406
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:19,480
he started asking

407
00:27:19,559 --> 00:27:20,599
whether I knew Su Lin.

408
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:25,000
So?

409
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,200
He probably knows her.

410
00:27:27,279 --> 00:27:28,519
He heard you're in her class

411
00:27:28,799 --> 00:27:30,039
and asked about her.

412
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:30,880
I don't care.

413
00:27:31,319 --> 00:27:32,720
I'm not being their stupid rep.

414
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,000
Then I just won't go abroad.

415
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,720
Oh, come on.

416
00:27:36,839 --> 00:27:38,799
I worked hard to arrange this.

417
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,359
You can't just quit.

418
00:27:40,359 --> 00:27:41,599
Do you know who I'll offend?

419
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,240
He treated me like a suspect,

420
00:27:43,279 --> 00:27:44,680
question after question.

421
00:27:45,079 --> 00:27:46,319
Then he even asked about you.

422
00:27:47,319 --> 00:27:48,640
About me? What did he ask?

423
00:27:49,119 --> 00:27:51,599
Whether you knew Su Lin's father.

424
00:27:58,280 --> 00:28:03,920
(Chaobei Towel Factory)

425
00:28:10,319 --> 00:28:11,200
These accounts

426
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,480
are making my head spin.

427
00:28:15,319 --> 00:28:16,319
Low blood sugar again?

428
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:17,839
No.

429
00:28:26,559 --> 00:28:27,160
Who do you need?

430
00:28:27,559 --> 00:28:28,039
Ms. Luo.

431
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,240
Don't you remember me?

432
00:28:29,799 --> 00:28:30,559
I'm Sun Weiming.

433
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:31,359
Sun.

434
00:28:32,279 --> 00:28:32,559
I...

435
00:28:32,559 --> 00:28:33,119
What is it?

436
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:33,759
Get out.

437
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,440
Out. Go!

438
00:28:35,599 --> 00:28:37,480
Stop pushing me.

439
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:38,440
That's enough.

440
00:28:39,119 --> 00:28:40,359
Why come to my workplace?

441
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:42,640
Nothing.

442
00:28:44,079 --> 00:28:44,759
I just want to talk.

443
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:45,799
We're done talking.

444
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:47,200
Nothing to discuss.

445
00:28:50,079 --> 00:28:51,119
No time today?

446
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:52,680
Then we'll talk tomorrow.

447
00:28:53,079 --> 00:28:54,079
Then the day after.

448
00:28:54,559 --> 00:28:56,720
Whenever you have time,

449
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:57,720
we'll talk.

450
00:29:03,560 --> 00:29:07,080
(Chaobei Smelter Residential Compound)

451
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:23,440
Come in.

452
00:29:37,519 --> 00:29:38,319
What are you doing?

453
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:43,519
Hello?

454
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:46,839
Page 9196748.

455
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:47,640
Message,

456
00:29:48,559 --> 00:29:49,960
I need to come back briefly.

457
00:29:50,759 --> 00:29:51,599
I forgot my keys.

458
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,039
Please bring them over.

459
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:54,839
Thanks.

460
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:58,559
What are you trying to do?

461
00:30:00,599 --> 00:30:01,119
Look around.

462
00:30:23,319 --> 00:30:23,880
How...

463
00:30:27,119 --> 00:30:28,240
How did you find out?

464
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,200
One time,

465
00:30:32,480 --> 00:30:34,039
I came back for some documents.

466
00:30:36,759 --> 00:30:38,240
I walked in and saw them.

467
00:30:52,839 --> 00:30:53,400
Yushu,

468
00:30:54,640 --> 00:30:55,640
could you

469
00:30:56,359 --> 00:30:57,559
give me a chance

470
00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:00,559
to make it up to you both?

471
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:13,119
I'm leaving for Beijing soon.

472
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:15,960
I'll be based there.

473
00:31:19,200 --> 00:31:20,799
What about things here?

474
00:31:22,359 --> 00:31:23,279
After a year,

475
00:31:24,839 --> 00:31:27,519
I'll file for divorce,

476
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:29,759
citing separation and incompatibility.

477
00:31:31,319 --> 00:31:32,039
What about your son?

478
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:35,759
My son...

479
00:31:38,519 --> 00:31:39,359
At first,

480
00:31:41,079 --> 00:31:42,759
she said he was premature.

481
00:31:42,839 --> 00:31:43,519
I believed her.

482
00:31:45,039 --> 00:31:46,079
After a while,

483
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,240
I noticed the boy

484
00:31:50,319 --> 00:31:52,920
looked more and more like that jerk.

485
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,119
You know?

486
00:31:54,799 --> 00:31:55,759
That child

487
00:31:56,799 --> 00:31:59,440
belongs to the factory director.

488
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:01,519
He has nothing to do with me.

489
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:12,240
So when you told me

490
00:32:13,839 --> 00:32:15,039
taking Jiang Ting to Beijing

491
00:32:15,039 --> 00:32:16,319
for her future

492
00:32:19,680 --> 00:32:22,119
was it because you were alone

493
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,480
and had nowhere else to turn?

494
00:32:23,599 --> 00:32:23,960
No.

495
00:32:24,039 --> 00:32:24,519
Then...

496
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,240
Yushu,

497
00:32:26,920 --> 00:32:27,720
that's not it.

498
00:32:29,119 --> 00:32:30,000
Isn't it?

499
00:32:30,079 --> 00:32:31,160
No. That's not what I meant.

500
00:32:31,440 --> 00:32:33,240
Why bring me here, then?

501
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:34,880
You were testing me.

502
00:32:35,279 --> 00:32:35,720
No.

503
00:32:36,079 --> 00:32:37,400
Then you talked around it

504
00:32:38,119 --> 00:32:39,200
and taking Jiang Ting away.

505
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,000
I... I didn't.

506
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:40,519
Didn't you?

507
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:41,279
No.

508
00:32:42,119 --> 00:32:42,640
Fine.

509
00:32:44,759 --> 00:32:45,359
Yushu,

510
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:46,920
listen to me.

511
00:32:47,319 --> 00:32:48,160
Ting

512
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:51,279
would be better off in Beijing

513
00:32:51,960 --> 00:32:53,359
than staying here.

514
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:54,920
Think about it.

515
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:56,640
You can't hold her back forever.

516
00:32:57,039 --> 00:32:59,119
Others may not know you, but I do.

517
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:00,839
It's been over twenty years.

518
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:03,640
I know exactly what you're like.

519
00:33:05,400 --> 00:33:07,119
No one can take advantage of you,

520
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:09,119
and you never accept a loss.

521
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:10,920
If you lose anything, you make it back.

522
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,759
Now you're making it back through me.

523
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:13,200
Aren't you?

524
00:33:13,359 --> 00:33:14,160
- Jiang Yushu.
- Tell me!

525
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:14,880
Jiang Yushu!

526
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:15,440
Tell me the truth!

527
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:16,640
I'm not talking about

528
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:17,279
twenty years ago.

529
00:33:17,480 --> 00:33:18,599
That's over.

530
00:33:18,599 --> 00:33:19,960
I'm talking about Ting.

531
00:33:20,119 --> 00:33:21,880
She told me herself.

532
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:24,000
She even told me when she plans

533
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,240
to study in Beijing.

534
00:33:25,279 --> 00:33:27,319
You knew none of this.

535
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:14,680
♪A faint heartbeat, scales drifting♪

536
00:34:15,360 --> 00:34:20,800
♪In briny dark, scorched gills appear♪

537
00:34:21,400 --> 00:34:26,440
♪An empty shell, a banished soul♪

538
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:32,360
♪Moonlight splinters into shards♪

539
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:38,400
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

540
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:43,239
♪Dust drifts through the silent abyss♪

541
00:34:43,239 --> 00:34:44,280
I don't have a home anymore.

542
00:35:38,960 --> 00:35:40,760
(When you lose your home,)

543
00:35:41,599 --> 00:35:42,880
(you suddenly realize)

544
00:35:44,719 --> 00:35:46,639
(the whole world)

545
00:35:47,719 --> 00:35:49,159
(has gone completely empty.)

546
00:35:55,880 --> 00:36:01,240
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

547
00:36:01,720 --> 00:36:06,920
♪Dust drifts through the silent abyss♪

548
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:12,600
♪Defiance scars your shoulders♪

549
00:36:13,240 --> 00:36:18,680
♪A light within refuses to die♪

550
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:24,520
♪From sunken ruins, a palace rises♪

551
00:36:25,280 --> 00:36:30,400
♪Near you, I hear wreckage sing♪

552
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:36,480
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

553
00:36:37,160 --> 00:36:42,320
♪Memories buried, sorrow forgotten♪

554
00:36:42,640 --> 00:36:48,000
♪Swim ahead, swim ahead♪

555
00:36:48,600 --> 00:36:55,120
♪Deep-sea wounds, we swim upstream♪

556
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:20,239
(Compared with a complex world)

557
00:37:20,239 --> 00:37:21,840
(built on abandonment and pain,)

558
00:37:22,639 --> 00:37:23,760
(this simple place)

559
00:37:23,760 --> 00:37:25,360
(filled with help and warmth)

560
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,360
(felt more like home)

561
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,360
(in that moment.)

562
00:37:30,120 --> 00:37:35,440
♪Swim ahead, swim ahead♪

563
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:42,480
♪Deep-sea wounds, we swim upstream♪

564
00:37:52,599 --> 00:37:54,199
Mom, why are the lights off?

565
00:37:55,039 --> 00:37:56,039
You scared me.

566
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,880
Mom, what's wrong?

567
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:13,320
What happened?

568
00:38:14,559 --> 00:38:16,159
Tell me.

569
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,360
Have I

570
00:38:23,679 --> 00:38:25,079
not taken good care of you?

571
00:38:26,039 --> 00:38:26,960
No.

572
00:38:28,079 --> 00:38:28,960
Or

573
00:38:30,199 --> 00:38:31,679
do you think I'm too controlling?

574
00:38:32,079 --> 00:38:33,800
That I never gave you freedom?

575
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:35,880
What are you talking about, Mom?

576
00:38:36,400 --> 00:38:37,119
I don't understand.

577
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,960
Why do you want to go with him?

578
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,920
I already explained it that day.

579
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:43,119
I'm not going to Beijing.

580
00:38:43,639 --> 00:38:44,880
I'm staying with you.

581
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:46,000
Stop lying to me.

582
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:51,320
You already knew he was leaving.

583
00:38:51,920 --> 00:38:53,400
You even told him

584
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:56,199
you wanted to go with him.

585
00:38:56,679 --> 00:38:57,599
Are you planning to

586
00:38:59,639 --> 00:39:01,239
move your registration there

587
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,320
and live with him?

588
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:03,400
No.

589
00:39:03,599 --> 00:39:05,199
I don't understand, Jiang Ting.

590
00:39:06,559 --> 00:39:08,280
Why are you so desperate

591
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:10,079
to leave with Sun Weiming?

592
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,480
What's wrong with this home?

593
00:39:11,880 --> 00:39:13,519
Why isn't it enough for you?

594
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:15,199
He told me everything.

595
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,400
He only took care of you

596
00:39:16,480 --> 00:39:17,599
for a few days,

597
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,360
and now you think he's great?

598
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:22,320
Or is it because he's richer

599
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,840
and can give you a better life?

600
00:39:24,840 --> 00:39:25,440
Is that it?

601
00:39:25,679 --> 00:39:27,320
You've always resented me.

602
00:39:27,440 --> 00:39:28,599
Nothing I do is ever enough!

603
00:39:28,599 --> 00:39:29,599
You ungrateful child!

604
00:39:29,599 --> 00:39:30,119
I haven't!

605
00:39:30,119 --> 00:39:31,639
You've always wanted to leave with him.

606
00:39:31,639 --> 00:39:32,239
Then go!

607
00:39:36,039 --> 00:39:36,599
Go!

608
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:38,719
Leave today!

609
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,679
Go!

610
00:39:39,760 --> 00:39:40,760
You'll go with him anyway.

611
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:41,960
What are you doing?

612
00:39:45,199 --> 00:39:46,679
What do you want from me?

613
00:39:52,679 --> 00:39:54,519
I've never resented you.

614
00:39:54,920 --> 00:39:55,880
Everything you just said,

615
00:39:55,880 --> 00:39:57,559
I've never thought any of it!

616
00:40:02,280 --> 00:40:04,519
I know raising me alone was hard.

617
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:07,519
Because we're a single-parent family,

618
00:40:07,519 --> 00:40:09,320
you're always afraid

619
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:10,320
people would hurt me.

620
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:12,000
But did you ever ask what I thought?

621
00:40:12,719 --> 00:40:14,800
Did you ever ask how I felt?

622
00:40:14,840 --> 00:40:16,760
I never thought that way.

623
00:40:19,119 --> 00:40:20,719
You told me to come straight home.

624
00:40:21,559 --> 00:40:24,000
So I always came straight home.

625
00:40:24,559 --> 00:40:26,599
I wanted to keep you company

626
00:40:26,679 --> 00:40:28,159
because I worried you'd be lonely.

627
00:40:28,239 --> 00:40:30,000
I came home to make you feel better.

628
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:32,599
What else do you want from me?

629
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:37,440
You said I should tell you everything.

630
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:39,159
But did you listen?

631
00:40:39,599 --> 00:40:41,639
Every time I tell you so much,

632
00:40:41,679 --> 00:40:43,599
you don't even hear

633
00:40:43,639 --> 00:40:45,000
what I'm actually saying.

634
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:48,400
You always tell me

635
00:40:48,480 --> 00:40:50,679
to look for the problem in myself,

636
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:51,679
to ask if it's my fault,

637
00:40:51,679 --> 00:40:52,599
not anyone else's.

638
00:40:52,599 --> 00:40:54,000
It's always the same lines.

639
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:57,320
Why won't you let me see Dad?

640
00:40:58,199 --> 00:40:59,679
Because you don't trust me.

641
00:41:03,119 --> 00:41:04,199
You don't believe me.

642
00:41:04,239 --> 00:41:05,440
You're afraid I'll go to Beijing

643
00:41:05,440 --> 00:41:07,280
and leave you here alone.

644
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:08,159
You call me selfish.

645
00:41:08,199 --> 00:41:09,559
Aren't you selfish too?

646
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,559
All this time,

647
00:41:30,079 --> 00:41:32,199
you had no idea what I went through.

648
00:41:36,559 --> 00:41:37,039
Yes.

649
00:41:40,119 --> 00:41:41,199
I did think about

650
00:41:41,519 --> 00:41:43,239
escaping this life as soon as I could.

651
00:41:43,639 --> 00:41:45,000
That's why I went to Dad.

652
00:41:45,199 --> 00:41:47,320
I told him I wanted to go to Beijing.

653
00:41:47,519 --> 00:41:49,119
Because I couldn't take it anymore.

654
00:41:49,159 --> 00:41:50,920
I felt like I couldn't breathe.

655
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:53,480
But in the end,

656
00:41:53,480 --> 00:41:56,079
didn't I choose to stay with you?

657
00:41:57,159 --> 00:41:59,440
What else do you want from me?

658
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:09,199
You don't know me at all.

659
00:43:18,440 --> 00:43:21,120
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

660
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:24,440
A man carried a woman

661
00:43:24,679 --> 00:43:25,840
into the underground pipes.

662
00:43:28,559 --> 00:43:31,280
This is where I found it.

663
00:43:31,960 --> 00:43:33,360
Zou Yue, female, age 27.

664
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:34,039
She went missing

665
00:43:34,039 --> 00:43:35,079
after 7 p.m. two nights ago.

666
00:43:35,840 --> 00:43:36,639
Look into it.

667
00:43:37,119 --> 00:43:39,360
See if it connects to the Weihong case.

668
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:41,880
(Missing Person)

669
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:43,559
June 5.

670
00:43:43,559 --> 00:43:45,599
Missing since a rainy night.

671
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:22,600
♪Never loud, never surging♪

672
00:44:23,360 --> 00:44:29,000
♪I gather my worries and build a wall♪

673
00:44:29,640 --> 00:44:33,320
♪Around me♪

674
00:44:34,080 --> 00:44:40,760
♪By my pillow, I hear a dark fairy tale♪

675
00:44:47,520 --> 00:44:53,680
♪One burst of pain,
a thousand flowers blooms♪

676
00:44:58,680 --> 00:45:04,920
♪Now I stand with myself♪

677
00:45:05,560 --> 00:45:09,400
♪Each becomes the other's shore♪

678
00:45:39,800 --> 00:45:46,200
♪By my pillow, I hear a dark fairy tale♪

679
00:45:53,320 --> 00:46:00,280
♪One burst of pain, a thousand blooms♪

680
00:46:05,080 --> 00:46:11,240
♪The struggle inside the silence♪

681
00:46:11,880 --> 00:46:18,560
♪Who can hear♪

682
00:46:18,560 --> 00:46:22,700
♪It?♪
